    {
      "id": "7af9b9b4-6566-452d-a31b-b208e387e947",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        7632,
        2768
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## B\u01af\u1edaC 1: KH\u1edeI T\u1ea0O DATA TABLE B\u1eb0NG L\u1ec6NH CREATE\n\n1. Click **Execute Workflow**.\n2. Node **Create Data Table** s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u1ef1c thi l\u1ec7nh t\u1ea1o b\u1ea3ng t\u00ean `CV_Screening_DB` v\u1edbi to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 16 c\u1ed9t chu\u1ea9n.\n3. L\u1ea5y ID c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3ng v\u1eeba t\u1ea1o (xem trong Output c\u1ee7a node), quay l\u1ea1i lu\u1ed3ng ch\u00ednh (Main Workflow) v\u00e0 d\u00e1n v\u00e0o node **Save Candidate Info**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a24d9f26-8f47-4d53-b923-5531807ff74e",
      "name": "Author Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        10592,
        2096
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 550,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Author\nHi! I am **Jay Nguyen (Nguyen Thieu Toan)** \u2014 Verified n8n Creator and CEO of GenStaff.\n* \ud83c\udf10 Website: [nguyenthieutoan.com](https://nguyenthieutoan.com)\n* \ud83c\udfe2 Company: GenStaff ([genstaff.net](https://genstaff.net))"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6e7a3112-1ba6-48f4-a71c-65e49e6ffc4e",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        7616,
        2096
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 736,
        "height": 352,
        "content": "## Collect application context\n\nReceives a candidate application through the form and adds fixed hiring context such as HR email, company name, job title, and job description for downstream evaluation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e6821efb-2f9a-4be8-9d32-e5304386a5f6",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        8368,
        2096
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 912,
        "height": 752,
        "content": "## Extract and analyze CV\n\nExtracts text from the uploaded PDF resume, sends it to the AI agent for evaluation, uses Gemini as the language model, and parses the AI output into a structured assessment."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b91ee95d-b918-4c14-aa71-3d97062dfafb",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        9312,
        2096
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 368,
        "content": "## Store and route score\n\nSaves the candidate evaluation to a data table, then checks whether the AI-generated score is above the configured threshold to route the application into the correct notification path."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9fea7a08-da92-46bd-b69d-cd48d11d3ff2",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        9776,
        2096
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## Send hiring notifications\n\nSends different Gmail notifications to HR depending on whether the candidate is high priority or standard, then sends a confirmation email back to the candidate."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
